        "Verify one signed Pyth Lazer batch and store each feed's observation.",
        "",
        "# Errors",
        "",
        "* Pyth Lazer verification fails.",
        "* The payload does not decode, names another channel, or lists a different",
        "feed count than the remaining accounts.",
        "* A feed is unknown, or its price aggregate account does not match or",
        "deserialize.",
        "* A feed property, price, confidence, exponent, or timestamp is invalid.",
        "* The source index exceeds observation capacity, or the account write fails.",
        "* The clock sysvar is unavailable.",
        "* An update event fails to emit."
